### Login (obtener token)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "student123"
}

### Listar blueprints (usar el JWT devuelto por login)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/blueprints
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear blueprint de prueba
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/blueprints
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "test-user",
  "name": "put-test",
  "points": [
    {"x": 0, "y": 0},
    {"x": 10, "y": 10}
  ]
}

### Agregar un punto (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/blueprints/test-user/put-test/points
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "x": 20,
  "y": 20
}

### Consultar el blueprint y verificar que el PUT persistió
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/blueprints/test-user/put-test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar todos los blueprints
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/blueprints
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Debe responder 401 Unauthorized (sin token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/blueprints/test-user/put-test
